{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Ban all machetes and introduce firearm-level penalties",
        "additional_details": "We urge the Government to amend the Criminal Justice Act 1988/Offensive Weapons Act 2019 and other relevant legislation to implement a complete ban.\r\n\r\nUnlawful machete possession should carry penalties comparable to possessing a prohibited firearm, including a maximum sentence of up to 10 years\u2019 imprisonment, with similar penalties for illegal manufacture and supply\r\n\r\nMachetes are unnecessary for most civilian purposes. Their potential to cause catastrophic injuries justifies stronger restrictions",
        "background": "We call on the UK Government to ban the manufacture, import, sale, supply and possession of all machetes, including in private homes and public places.",
